  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1158898427640422500/ec_cjgn_plugin_title.png?ex=651debc4&is=651c9a44&hm=9942ab87cb2d0149fb5556dc000822ddaa709df1116b39d82404466aa2ca61f9&\" alt=\"Expanded Combat CJ Netherite 插件标题图\" width=\"445\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fec-cjgn-plugin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"可在 Modrinth 获取\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.2/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Cloth Config API\" width=\"212\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152401406247047188/curios_api_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Curios API\" width=\"179\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152636014880366763/expanded_combat_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Expanded Combat\" width=\"252\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gilded-netherite-cj-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1158898406241083436/cjs_netherite_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 CJ&#x27;s Gilded Netherite\" width=\"224\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一款为 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Combat</a> 制作的插件 Mod，用于添加与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gilded-netherite-cj-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gilded Netherite CJ Edition</a> 的镀金下界合金（Gilded Netherite）材质的兼容支持。</p>\n<h4>新增以下材质支持：</h4>\n<p>镀金下界合金：包含我的主 Mod <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Combat</a> 中添加的箭袋、武器和护手。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><strong>重要提示：</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>如需报告 Bug，请使用 GitHub 上的问题追踪器 <a href=\"https://github.com/userofbricks/Expanded-Combat/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>如需交流讨论或其他事宜，请加入 Discord <a href=\"https://discord.gg/7cR4Vwv\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>点击横幅获取折扣：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fuserofbricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d94f7046-2c94-404e-a3dc-3a798daef810.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
